UPDATE companies SET description='Moody Mountain Solar operates from Searsmont, Maine, and was founded in the spring of 2020 by Cory Alexander. After 15 years in the boat-building industry and a lifetime of off-grid living at sea and on land, Alexander started the company to deliver a more personalized solar design and installation experience. The business remains owner-operated, with Alexander serving as the NABCEP-certified system designer and the single point of contact for every project.

The company installs rooftop arrays, ground-mount systems, and off-grid power solutions across Midcoast Maine and the islands of Penobscot Bay. Its rooftop work emphasizes roof integrity, drawing on building-trades experience to ensure watertight mounts on asphalt, metal, and EPDM surfaces. Ground-mount installations incorporate bifacial panels, while off-grid systems use modern lithium battery storage.

Customers include homeowners seeking grid-tied systems, seasonal camps replacing generators, and island properties requiring micro-grid independence.

Alexander founded Moody Mountain Solar to offer premium service at a reasonable cost while maintaining a neighborly, community-focused approach.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar system design", "Rooftop solar installation", "Ground mount solar installation", "Off-grid solar system installation", "Battery storage integration (Lithium)", "Site assessment and consultation"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Off-grid power systems", "Renewable energy installation", "Marine/off-grid living"], "materials": ["Q-Cell solar modules", "Bifacial solar panels", "Lithium batteries", "Asphalt roofing", "Metal roofing", "EPDM roofing"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["NABCEP certified owner/system designer on-site during installation", "Single point of contact throughout project", "Building trades background ensuring roof integrity", "Off-grid and island micro-grid expertise", "Q-Cell solar modules and bifacial panel options"], "facts_used": ["Founded spring 2020 -> /about-us", "Owner Cory Alexander -> /about-us", "NABCEP certified owner/system designer -> /about-us", "Single point of contact, on-site during installation -> /about-us", "Background: 15 years boat-building, off-grid living -> /about-us", "Services: rooftop, ground mount, off-grid -> /services", "Rooftop specialty, roof integrity, building trades background -> /services", "Q-Cell solar modules -> /services", "Ground mounts with bifacial panels -> /services", "Off-grid with lithium battery technology -> /services", "Service area: Midcoast Maine and islands of Penobscot Bay -> db", "Founded year 2020 from database -> db", "Headquarters Searsmont, Maine -> db"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Moody Mountain Solar was born in the spring of 2020 out of a desire to provide a more personalized solar design and installation experience.", "founded_year": "2020", "em