UPDATE companies SET description='Motion Lite operates from a shop on O’Neal Lane in Baton Rouge, Louisiana. The company was founded in 2020 by Gabriel Huggins, who had been working in the low‑voltage trade since 2015. Huggins holds a Louisiana contractor license (#77424), is a BICSI member, and has completed OSHA 30 construction safety training.

The firm provides a full suite of low‑voltage and technology services: structured cabling (Cat5e, Cat6, Cat6A, and fiber optic), IP security camera systems with NVR/DVR recording up to 4K resolution, night vision, thermal imaging, and remote access; AV integration including TV matrix switching, distributed audio, digital signage, LED video walls, and conference‑room technology for Teams and Zoom; access‑control systems using key fobs, card readers, biometrics, and mobile credentials; IT deployment of monitor arms, docks, and peripherals; and custom PC builds for gaming, professional workstations, and business use, with options for bring‑your‑own‑parts assembly and bulk office orders. The team has completed more than 250 projects across Louisiana and neighboring states.

Motion Lite serves commercial clients in offices, restaurants, schools, warehouses, and distribution centers, as well as bars, churches, and healthcare facilities requiring HIPAA‑compliant infrastructure. Recent work includes an 80‑camera Cisco Meraki deployment with outdoor Wi‑Fi at a distribution center in Walker, a 40‑drop network with six access points and a sound system for a Baton Rouge business, and an eight‑panel LED video wall for a restaurant in Lafayette. The company covers the Baton Rouge metro area — Denham Springs, Gonzales, Hammond — and travels to New Orleans, Lafayette, and Shreveport; for warehouse and distribution projects it works across Louisiana, Texas, Arkansas, Mississippi, Alabama, and Florida.

The company emphasizes a single‑contractor model that eliminates the need to coordinate separate cabling, security, AV, and access‑control vendors. It promotes honest pricing, long‑term support after installation, and the technical rigor that comes from BICSI membership and OSHA 30 training.', certifications=ARRAY['Louisiana contractor license #77424','BICSI member','OSHA 30']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structured cabling (Cat5e, Cat6, Cat6A, fiber optic)", "IP security camera installation (HD to 4K, night vision, thermal, remote access)", "NVR/DVR setup and configuration", "AV integration (TV matrix switching, distributed audio, digital signage, LED walls)", "Conference room AV (Teams/Zoom rooms, wireless presentation, one-touch control)", "Access control systems (key fob, card reader, biometric, mobile credential, video intercom)", "Multi-site access control management", "IT deployment (monitor arms, multi-monitor desks, docks, peripherals)", "Custom PC assembly (gaming rigs, workstations, business computers)", "Bring-your-own-parts PC assembly", "Bulk workstation builds", "VoIP and camera wiring", "Cable testing and certification"], "industries": ["Commercial offices", "Restaurants and bars", "Schools and educational facilities", "Warehouses and distribution centers", "Churches and religious facilities", "Healthcare (HIPAA-compliant infrastructure)"], "materials": ["Cat5e, Cat6, Cat6A, fiber optic cabling", "IP security cameras", "NVR/DVR recording systems", "AV equipment (displays, audio, digital signage, LED panels)", "Access control hardware (key fobs, card readers, biometric readers)", "PC components (CPUs, GPUs, motherboards, memory, storage)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Cabling, cameras, AV, and access control from one contractor", "Licensed low\u2011voltage contractor (Louisiana license #77424)", "BICSI member and OSHA 30 trained", "Local, post\u2011install support for service calls, expansions, and upgrades", "Test\u2011and\u2011label every cable drop for easy IT management"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2020 by Gabriel Huggins -> /about", "Licensed low voltage contractor Louisiana license #77424 -> /", "BICSI member and OSHA 30 trained -> /about", "Services: structured cabling, security cameras, AV, access control, IT deployment, custom PC builds -> /services", "Industries served: offices, restaurants, schools, warehouses, distribution centers, bars, churches, healthcare -> /", "Project examples: 80+ Cisco Meraki cameras at Walker distribution center, 40-drop network in Baton Rouge, 8-panel LED video wall in Lafayette -> /", "Coverage area: Baton Rouge, Denham Springs, Gonzales, Hammond, New Orleans, Lafayette, Shreveport; warehouse jobs in LA, TX, AR, MS, AL, FL -> /", "Shop on O''Neal Lane in Baton Rouge -> /", "250+ projects completed -> /", "10+ years experience (Gabriel since 2015) -> /about"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Motion Lite is a licensed low voltage contractor (Louisiana license #77424) working out of a shop on O''Neal Lane in Baton Rouge.", "founded_year": "2020", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='motion-lite-baton-rouge-technology-solutions' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Mountain Drivetrain LLC operates driveline service shops in Riverton, Wyoming and Centralia, Washington. The company is an owner-operated driveline shop specializing in repair, replacement, and custom fabrication of drivelines.

The shop provides driveline repair, replacement, and custom fabrication for one-, two-, and three-piece drivelines in aluminum or steel, metric and standard sizes. Services include re-tubing, U-joint installation, component replacement, precision spin balancing, and constant-velocity (CV) joint repair. The company also distributes driveline and PTO parts, maintaining an extensive inventory for light- and heavy-duty trucks, industrial, marine, and agricultural applications. Same-day and after-hours service are available.

Mountain Drivetrain serves customers in off-road, light- and heavy-duty truck, marine, oilfield, agricultural, semi-truck, and heavy-equipment industries. Its clientele includes individual truck owners, marine operators, agricultural businesses, and industrial fleets. Testimonials reference customers from Lander, Thermopolis, and the surrounding Wyoming area.

The company emphasizes friendly service, quality workmanship, and fast turn-around to retain customers. Its owner-operated model and extensive parts inventory enable same-day repairs and custom fabrication without long lead times.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Driveline repair", "Driveline replacement", "Custom driveline fabrication", "Re-tubing", "U-joint installation", "Component replacement", "Precision spin balancing", "Constant-velocity (CV) joint repair", "Parts distribution (driveline and PTO)", "PTO driveshaft parts supply", "PTO CV parts supply", "Aluminum fabrication", "Steel fabrication", "Metric and standard sizing", "Light-duty truck driveline service", "Heavy-duty truck driveline service", "Same-day service", "After-hours service"], "industries": ["Off-road", "Light-duty trucks", "Heavy-duty trucks", "Marine", "Oilfield", "Agricultural", "Semi-truck", "Heavy equipment", "Industrial"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day service available; fast turn-around", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Same-day service available", "After-hours service available", "Extensive inventory of driveline and PTO parts", "Owner-operated with decades of experience", "Precision spin balancing for one-, two-, and three-piece drivelines"], "facts_used": ["Operates shops in Riverton, WY and Centralia, WA -> /", "Owner-operated driveline shop -> /about", "Specializes in driveline repair, replacement, custom fabrication -> /about", "Offers same-day and after-hours service -> /", "Distributes driveline and PTO parts with extensive inventory -> /", "Serves off-road, light/heavy duty trucks, marine, oilfield, agricultural, semi-truck, heavy equipment -> / and /about", "Works with aluminum and steel, metric and standard -> /", "Provides re-tubing, U-joint installation, component replacement, precision spin balancing, CV repair -> /", "Testimonials from customers in Lander, Thermopolis, Wyoming -> /"],