UPDATE companies SET description='NB Electrical Enclosure Manufacturer Inc. operates from Brooklyn, New York, and was founded in 2006 by Neville Bearam. Bearam, who previously served as a project manager at Harbor Electric Fabrication & Tool (HEFTI), launched the company after accumulating over 25 years in sheet metal fabrication, including expertise in welding, shearing, bending, and CNC programming. The business is certified as a Minority Business Enterprise (MBE) and holds accreditation and affiliation with the International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers (IBEW).

