UPDATE companies SET description='NC Solar Electric LLC operates from Statesville, North Carolina, where founder Todd Desiato established the company after decades of solving technical problems for energy customers. Desiato created the business to make high-quality solar more accessible to homeowners, farmers, and small businesses seeking affordable equipment, honest advice, and real engineering support.

