UPDATE companies SET description='NW Innovative Technologies operates from Hillsboro, Oregon, in the heart of the state''s technology corridor.

The shop provides full-spectrum electronic manufacturing services, including surface-mount and through-hole PCB assembly on boards up to 58 inches long, BGA and leadless device placement, rework, electro-mechanical assembly, and complete system builds. It offers both consignment and turnkey procurement, along with test fixture design, conformal coating, supply chain management, and functional testing.

Customers come from military, avionics, industrial, medical, and energy management sectors. The firm also lists industrial, military, and commercial verticals broadly. Its engineering staff includes electrical engineers, physicists, mechanical engineers, and software developers who support design-for-manufacturability and design-for-testability reviews.

