UPDATE companies SET description='New England Wire Technologies is based in Lisbon, New Hampshire. The company traces its origins to 1898, when it began as a local wire producer. Over more than a century it has grown into a global engineering partner while remaining headquartered in the same town.

The company designs and manufactures custom wire and cable solutions, including high‑performance Litz wire for high‑frequency applications, multi‑conductor cables for data transmission and power distribution, hybrid cable configurations, and custom tubing for medical, aerospace, and industrial uses.

Its customers span medical device makers, aerospace contractors, and industrial equipment manufacturers. The firm also serves broader markets through subsidiaries: New England Tubing Technologies in Lisbon, Bay Associates Wire Technologies (operating as BayCable) in Fremont, California, and New England Interconnect Systems in Santa Ana, Mexico.

