UPDATE companies SET description='New Mexico Fabrics and Foam, also operating as R&R Trim Supply, is a family-owned business founded in 1985 by Robert and Ray Sanchez and Caroline Day in Albuquerque, New Mexico. The company began as a supplier of upholstery materials, building on the Sanchez family''s 52-year history in the upholstery trade.

