UPDATE companies SET description='North American Plastics Ltd. operates from Manchester, New Hampshire, as a provider of custom extrusion blow molding and blow molding product solutions. The company serves customers seeking custom containers and components across multiple industries.

The firm specializes in extrusion blow molding, producing both regular and irregular shaped parts with control over wall thickness, part size, color, and diameter. Its capabilities extend to industrial plastic bottle molding, bellows, and custom parts from design through production. The facility manufactures components for aerosol cans, truck cab components, drive shaft parts, electronics housings, consumer packaging, and thin-wall medical components.

North American Plastics serves the medical, telecommunications, sports and recreation, consumer products, and industrial sectors. Medical customers source bottles and thin-wall components, while industrial clients include automotive, electronics, and packaging companies. The company states it can produce custom containers for any business and industry specific to their uses.

The company holds ISO 9001:2015 certification and emphasizes cost-effective, high-quality custom blow molded parts with expanding capabilities. It works with customers from design to production, offering tailored solutions for exact specifications.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Extrusion blow molding", "Custom blow molding", "Industrial plastic bottle molding", "Bellows manufacturing", "Design to production support", "Wall thickness control", "Part size control", "Color matching", "Diameter control"], "industries": ["Medical", "Telecommunications", "Sports & Recreation", "Consumer Products", "Industrial", "Automotive", "Electronics", "Packaging", "Aerosol"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ISO 9001:2015 certified", "Custom extrusion blow molding expertise", "Design-to-production support", "Regular and irregular shape molding capability", "Cost-effective, high-quality part production"], "facts_used": ["Company name and location -> db", "ISO 9001:2015 certification -> db, page /", "Primary process: custom extrusion blow molding -> db, page /", "Capabilities: regular/irregular shapes, wall thickness, size, color, diameter control -> db", "Products: bottles, bellows, custom parts, medical components, aerosol can components, truck cab components, drive shaft parts, electronics parts, consumer packaging, industrial components -> db", "Industries served: medical, telecommunications, sports & recreation, consumer products, industrial -> db", "Design to production support -> db", "Cost-effective, high-quality custom blow molded parts -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "North American Plastics is a provider of custom extrusion blow molding and blow molding product solutions", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "owners